<g><title>through sending&#xA;t = 5</title><line x1="1289" y1="68" x2="1289" y2="96" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2"/><animate attributeName="opacity" calcMode="discrete" values="0;1" keyTimes="0;0.7407" dur="9s" repeatCount="indefinite"/></g>
<g id="l0s6"><title>waiting | charged (time)&#xA;t = 6, held for no time (open at the end of the run)</title><line x1="1489" y1="68" x2="1489" y2="96" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2"/><animate attributeName="opacity" calcMode="discrete" values="0;1" keyTimes="0;0.8889" dur="9s" repeatCount="indefinite"/></g>
<g><title>choice: choice entering modes: next waiting(entry), charged(entry) (unordered; took waiting(entry) first; independent)&#xA;t = 0</title><path d="M289 77l5 5l-5 5l-5 -5z" fill="#f1c40f" stroke="#7d6608"/></g>
</g>
<g id="l1">
<rect x="289" y="106" width="1200" height="28" fill="#f4f6f8"/>
<text x="16" y="125">RunTimeline::mission.instrument.modes</text>
